  "answer_text": "Here's some information about **\"Still in Love with You\"** by **Brooks & Dunn**:\n\n- **\"Still in Love with You\"** is the tenth track on Brooks & Dunn's album *Brand New Man*.\n\n- The song was released in **1991**.\n\n- It was written by **Don Cook, Kix Brooks, and Ronnie Dunn**, and has a runtime of **3:34**.\n\nThe song is a classic country heartbreak tune about a person who, despite leaving a relationship, can't escape their feelings. The narrator imagines riding off on a horse or flying away, but no matter what, they'd still wake up in love.\n\nYou can find it on **Spotify**, **Deezer**, and **YouTube** to give it a listen! \ud83c\udfb6\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f *Note: I'm unable to reproduce the full song lyrics here due to copyright, but you can find them on licensed lyrics sites.*",
